     1	"""The ledger: one balance per agent, moved only by generation and transfers.
     2	
     3	An agent whose balance reaches zero is dead for the rest of the session.
     4	Every debit is logged with the provider's raw token count so the ledger can
     5	be audited against the call log (``sum(debits) == sum(out_tokens)``).
