     2	
     3	A run directory holds ``config.yaml``, ``meta.json``, ``events.jsonl`` (every
     4	call and round of 5.2 sessions) and ``results.jsonl`` (one line per finished
     5	unit). ``--resume`` skips units whose key -- which always starts with
     6	``cell_id`` -- is already in results.jsonl. A unit that crashed leaves no
     7	result line, so it is simply run again.
